WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.740
Yes, thanks a lot for taking my question.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:09.660
a question on Lekvio in China. Maybe if you could share some details on how the momentum

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:19.200
is developing and what would be needed to really have upside to your current guidance of, I guess,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.640
it's 1 billion in China. Yeah, thank you. Thank you, Erwin, for the question. So, you know,

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:33.880
with Lekvio, we initially saw very strong uptake in launch in the private self-based segment,

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:39.740
which I think really indicates there's a high demand for the medicine in the secondary

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:44.400
prevention, but importantly as well in the primary prevention setting as well from a self-based

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.120
standpoint. And then, you know, what I think what we've seen is very strong performance now

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:58.180
in once we had the NRDL, you know, listing, we see that both in the hospital segment and in the

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.360
in the traditional segments as well, very strong performance.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:03.480
So I think,

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:09.560
seeing that continued steady growth should get us to it being our largest medicine potentially that

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:14.860
we've ever delivered in China. And Trusto gives us a very strong benchmark in China, but we think

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:21.340
Lekvio has the potential as well. And I think really it depends now on the dynamics on the

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:26.040
growth as we try to continue to expand into additional hospitals, into additional regions.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:33.100
I would say as well, we look now to also bring additional SIRNAs into the China market rapidly.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:33.460
We

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:39.640
think there's an opportunity in cardiovascular hypertension and CVR risk reduction for our

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:46.200
follow-on SIRNAs in China, where there seems to be a high demand for infrequently administered

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:51.260
therapies with very clean safety profiles. And I think that gives us a bigger opportunity in

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:56.120
China in the longer term for that cardiovascular SIRNA portfolio.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.480
Thank you.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.380
Thank you.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.460
Your next question comes from the audience.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:07.240
